@startuml
title Deployment 1 of 2: Java Swing MVP (proposed; collaboration decision open)
left to right direction

node "User workstation" as Workstation {
  artifact "Signed SplitSmart desktop package\nJava 21 + Swing" as Client
  database "Optional local demo store" as LocalStore
  folder "Optional protected local receipt files" as LocalReceipts
  Client --> LocalStore
  Client --> LocalReceipts
}

cloud "Approved network boundary\nonly if collaborative MVP selected" as Network
node "Proposed shared service environment" as ServiceEnv {
  artifact "Authenticated application service" as MvpService
  database "Durable transactional store" as MvpDB
  folder "Private receipt storage" as MvpFiles
  artifact "In-app notification records" as MvpInbox
  MvpService --> MvpDB
  MvpService --> MvpFiles
  MvpService --> MvpInbox
}

Client --> Network : encrypted authenticated connection
Network --> MvpService
note bottom of LocalStore
  Local-only mode is a constrained demonstration;
  it cannot provide remote shared records/notices.
end note
note bottom of MvpService
  Server hosting, identity, persistence, receipt storage,
  monitoring, backup and recovery are unselected proposals.
end note
@enduml

@startuml
title Deployment 2 of 2: Complete Web, Android and iOS Product (proposed)
left to right direction

cloud "Public client networks" as ClientNet
node "User devices" as Devices {
  artifact "Browser\nweb client" as Web
  artifact "Signed Android app" as Android
  artifact "Signed iOS app" as IOS
}

node "Approved service environment" as ServiceEnv {
  artifact "Authenticated versioned API" as API
  artifact "Shared domain/application service" as App
  artifact "Identity integration" as Identity
  database "Transactional primary data" as DB
  folder "Private receipt object/file store" as ReceiptStore
  artifact "In-app inbox and delivery adapters" as Notifications
  artifact "Metrics, audit and operational logs" as Observability

  API --> App
  App --> Identity
  App --> DB
  App --> ReceiptStore
  App --> Notifications
  App --> Observability
}

Web --> ClientNet
Android --> ClientNet
IOS --> ClientNet
ClientNet --> API : encrypted authenticated API
note bottom of DB
  Vendor, region, backup policy, RPO/RTO and operations are not selected.
  Shared data authority is required for cross-platform consistency.
end note
@enduml
